      "title": "USBLL: Dissect speed specific linktypes",
      "message": "USBLL: Dissect speed specific linktypes\n\nUSB 2.0/1.1/1.0 devices (or 3.x and newer when connected to hosts that\nare not Super-Speed capable) operate at one of three speeds:\n  * Low-Speed (1.5 Mbps)\n  * Full-Speed (12 Mbps)\n  * High-Speed (480 Mbps)\n\nSupporting speed specific linktypes allows speed specific dissection\nwithout the need for user to manually set the speed.\n",
      "author_name": "Tomasz Moń",
      "author_email": "desowin@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-05-31T06:24:25.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Tomasz Moń",
